\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p579729551.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1303099172.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2235668582.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2235668563.webp\"]","descs":"本片根据印度畅销书作家奇坦·巴哈特（Chetan Bhagat）的处女作小说《五点人》（Five Point Someone）改编而成。法兰（马德哈万 R Madhavan 饰）、拉杜（沙曼·乔希 Sharman Joshi 饰）与兰乔（阿米尔·汗 Aamir Khan 饰）是皇家工程学院的学生，三人共居一室，结为好友。在以严格著称的学院里，兰乔是个非常与众不同的学生，他不死记硬背，甚至还公然顶撞校长“病毒”（波曼·伊拉尼 Boman Irani 饰），质疑他的教学方法。他不仅鼓动法兰与拉杜去勇敢追寻理想，还劝说校长的二女儿碧雅（卡琳娜·卡普 Kareena Kapoor 饰）离开满眼铜臭的未婚夫。兰乔的特立独行引起了模范学生“消音器”（奥米·维嘉 Omi Vaidya 饰）的不满，他约定十年后再与兰乔一决高下，看哪种生活方式更能取得成功。\n　　本片获孟... (展开全部) ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1QDciVTEmgCqAfXt6PVDcmA?pwd=pse6\",\"size\":\"2.83\",\"date\":\"2025-08-27\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":405,"title":"爱在黎明破晓前","ratingNum":8.8,"ratingbetterthan":"","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2555762374.webp","tag":"爱情","address":" 美国 / 奥地利 / 瑞士","years":"1995","date":"","photos":null,"descs":"美国青年杰西（伊桑·霍克 Ethan Hawke 饰）在火车上偶遇了法国女学生塞琳娜（朱莉·德尔佩 Julie Delpy 饰），两人在火车上交谈甚欢。当火车到达维也纳时，杰西盛情邀请塞琳娜一起在维也纳游览一番，即使杰西翌日便要坐飞机离开。与杰西一见钟情的塞琳娜接受了杰西的邀请。\n　　他们一边游览城市，一边谈论着彼此的过去 ，彼此对生活的感想，两人了解越加深刻。他们非常珍惜这美妙的晚上，这对恋人一起经历了很多浪漫的经历因为他们约定在半年后再见，而此次约会将会在日出之间结束…… ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1vAMh-jbHiwsJhqwr5uYzgg?pwd=64yb\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":1377,"title":"幸福终点站 The Terminal","ratingNum":8.8,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 98% 喜剧片\n好于 97% 剧情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2181698213.webp","tag":"No.144豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 美国","years":"2004","date":"2005-01-14(中国大陆)、2004-06-18(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p544752084.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2181700278.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2181700394.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2181700288.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2923697735.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p854757687.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p792263736.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2181700002.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2181699988.webp\"]","descs":"为了完成父亲的心愿，维克多（汤姆•汉克斯 Tom Hanks 饰）从故国乘坐飞机前往美国肯尼迪机场，但戏剧性的事情发生了：他被告知祖国发生政变，而他的身份证护照一一失效，同时他的签证也无法再使用。进退两难的维克多只有在机场滞留，等待新证件的办理。\n　　但是，他在机场等待了整整9个月。在这9个月里面，他用机场的洗手间洗漱，在候机室睡觉，他已经学懂因地制宜，在机场照料自己的生活，甚至还找了一份建筑工地工作。然而维克多的邋遢晦气却招来了机场负责人弗兰克（史坦利•图齐 Stanley Tucci 饰）的不满，而恐怕更令他气愤妒忌的是，美丽的空姐艾米利亚（凯瑟琳•泽塔-琼斯 Catherine Zeta-Jones 饰）竟然爱上了维克多。处在甜蜜中的维克多，也在慢慢观察机场的人生百态，自得其乐。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1CIVdRs9mdBKYdgwJ8tdPcQ?pwd=pqhy\",\"size\":\"2.04\",\"date\":\"2025-08-26\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":949,"title":"迷魂记 Vertigo","ratingNum":8.7,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 97% 爱情片\n好于 98% 悬疑片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1275162115.webp","tag":"爱情,悬疑,惊悚","address":" 美国","years":"1958","date":"1958-05-09(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1092132261.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1092122694.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p464342286.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1092134138.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p825305964.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2640735300.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1275143149.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1527296951.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2532157586.webp\"]","descs":"退役警探约翰·弗格森（詹姆斯·斯图尔特 James Stewart 饰）的同学加文·埃尔斯特（汤姆·赫尔莫 Tom Helmore 饰）是造船商。他请求约翰跟踪自己的妻子，并称妻子经常被鬼魂附身。随后，约翰按照加文的指示，在厄尼餐厅见到了一位美丽的女人（金姆·诺瓦克 Kim Novak 饰）。经过跟踪，约翰发现女人确有不同寻常的行为：开车出门，去花店买花，去墓园在卡洛塔·巴尔德斯的碑前驻足，去荣勋宫博物馆凝视卡洛塔画像，最后进入麦基屈克旅馆并出现在二楼的一扇窗前。约翰随即进入旅馆调查，发现女人登记名为卡洛塔·巴尔德斯，但其房中无人。卡洛塔·巴尔德斯究竟是何方神圣，鬼魂真的能附身活人吗？ ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1Y0U8ZfhVGNszJKCsq30wTA?pwd=nhfy\",\"size\":\"1.13\",\"date\":\"2025-07-07\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":967,"title":"初恋这件小事 สิ่งเล็กเล็กที่เรียกว่า...รัก","ratingNum":8.5,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 96% 剧情片\n好于 98% 喜剧片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1505312273.webp","tag":"No.220豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 泰国","years":"2010","date":"2012-06-05(中国大陆)、2010-08-12(泰国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1571472027.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1571473740.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1571472151.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1571471743.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1571471854.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1505312273.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1570179660.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p628099967.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p628099255.webp\"]","descs":"初中生小水相貌平平，家境一般，所以在学校里并不受重视。但是她心地善良，又有一群死党，日子过得倒也开心。某天，她遇见了帅气的学长阿亮（马里奥·毛瑞尔 Mario Maurer 饰），春心萌动，无 法遏制。她喜欢看他踢足球，看他拍照，如痴如狂。上英语课时，她不停地给死党传纸条 表达对阿亮的爱慕。然而，英语老师则指出她除了英语一无是处。回到家，叔叔从美国捎来了父亲的消息，说如果她能考全校第一，就可以去美国。于是，她按下决心要努力加油。某天，小水等人在买饮料时，碰到篮球队员蛮横插队。阿亮挺身而出，为她们教训了对方，并挨了校长的责骂。小水也第一次听说，阿亮的父亲因为射失点球而退役的事情，理解了他心中的隐痛。由于舞蹈队是给美女准备的，所以小水等一干姐妹准备在话剧社大展身手，没想到学长也来到这个社团。两人还扮演王子公主，他们的恋情会由此展开么？…… ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/12GVVJswov9YkhYghQBJo0Q?pwd=1vhn\",\"size\":\"0.91\",\"date\":\"2025-07-08\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":783,"title":"好久没做 LTNS","ratingNum":8.4,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 92% 剧情片\n好于 90% 喜剧片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2903174519.webp","tag":"No.3|豆瓣2024评分最高韩国剧集","address":" 韩国","years":"2024","date":"","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2903994014.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2897248513.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2903994008.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2903175661.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2903607306.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2903174519.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2903174626.webp\"]","descs":"该剧是一部喜剧，讲述因生活而关系变得疏远的夫妇为了赚钱而威胁不忠的情侣，并在此过程中面对他们已经破裂的的关系。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1eaeIZzTugf1UIgxIRiB06A?pwd=7eq5\",\"size\":\"3.82\",\"date\":\"2025-06-21\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":934,"title":"情人 L'amant","ratingNum":8.2,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 93% 剧情片\n好于 92% 传记片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1674536431.webp","tag":"No.4|评分最高情色片","address":" 法国 / 英国 / 越南","years":"1992","date":"1992-01-22(法国)、1992-06-19(英国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/